================================================================================
Cryptographic disclosure
================================================================================

This product uses the Ed25519 signature scheme (RFC 8032) and RFC 8785
canonical JSON for signature payload normalization. No cryptographic
primitives are implemented in this project; verification is delegated to
`cryptography` (https://cryptography.io/), which itself wraps OpenSSL.
